title: Whispers in Ferraz
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: lead_rumours_due = 1 and lead_challenge_due = 0 and lead_forced_due = 0 and sanchez_leader = 1 and election_year = 0
on-arrival: lead_stage = 1

= Whispers in Ferraz

The stories start in the Madrid press: unnamed "historic leaders" and "senior figures in the federations" who doubt that Pedro Sánchez can win. Nobody puts a name to them yet. Everybody knows who they are.

- @r_ignore: Ignore it: rumours die if you do not feed them
- @r_address: Address it: meet the federations and the deputies one by one
- @r_bluff: Call their bluff: challenge the critics to say it to your face
- @r_primary: Call their bluff: call a leadership election yourself

@r_ignore
on-arrival: regional_leaders_dissent += 4; member_morale -= 2

The rumours do not die. They wait.

@r_address
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchez_authority += 5 + Q.member_morale / 12; Q.regional_leaders_dissent -= 3; Q.institutionalists_dissent -= 3; Q.month_actions += 1; !}

A fortnight of meetings and phone calls. It buys time, and some of the barons are flattered to be asked.

@r_bluff
on-arrival: {!
Q.populism += 1; Q.lead_confronted = 1;
Q.bluff_won = (Q.federal_committee_balance + Q.member_morale / 4 + (Math.random() * 12 - 6) >= 55) ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.bluff_won) { Q.sanchez_authority += 15; Q.regional_leaders_dissent -= 8; Q.institutionalists_dissent -= 6; Q.sanchismo += 4; }
else { Q.sanchez_authority -= 12; Q.regional_leaders_dissent += 8; }
!}

[? if bluff_won = 1 : "If anyone wants my job, let them stand in a primary." Nobody does. For now, the critics retreat. ?][? if bluff_won = 0 : You dare them, and they take note. The critics are now openly counting votes in the Federal Committee. ?]

@r_primary
on-arrival: {! Q.populism += 1; Q.sanchismo += 3; window.SpainGame.leadershipElection(Q, 6); !}
go-to: primary_result

@primary_result
title: The leadership election

= The leadership election

[? if primary_won = 1 : The members vote, and they vote for you. With a fresh mandate from the rank and file, the critics have nothing left to say for a while. ?][? if primary_won = 0 : The members vote, and they choose [+ psoe_leader +]. Pedro Sánchez is no longer Secretary-General of the PSOE. ?]

@lead_challenge
title: A challenger emerges
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: lead_challenge_due = 1 and lead_forced_due = 0 and sanchez_leader = 1 and election_year = 0
on-arrival: lead_stage = 2

= A challenger emerges

The anonymous critics now have a name: [+ challenger +]. Seven regional federations are collecting signatures for an extraordinary leadership election, and the papers are already printing the arithmetic of the Federal Committee.

- @c_ignore: Ignore it and get on with the job
- @c_address: Address it: a speech to the parliamentary group, a tour of the federations
- @c_bluff: Call their bluff: dare them to table the motion in the Federal Committee
- @c_primary: Call their bluff: call the leadership election yourself, now

@c_ignore
on-arrival: sanchez_authority -= 5; regional_leaders_dissent += 6; federal_committee_balance -= 4

Silence looks like weakness. More signatures arrive.

@c_address
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchez_authority += 4 + Q.member_morale / 15; Q.regional_leaders_dissent -= 2; Q.federal_committee_balance += 2; Q.month_actions += 1; !}

You make your case. It steadies the group, but [+ challenger +] has not gone away.

@c_bluff
on-arrival: {!
Q.populism += 1; Q.lead_confronted = 1;
Q.bluff_won = (Q.federal_committee_balance + Q.member_morale / 4 + (Math.random() * 12 - 6) >= 60) ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.bluff_won) { Q.sanchez_authority += 18; Q.regional_leaders_dissent -= 12; Q.sanchismo += 6; Q.lead_stage = 0; }
else { Q.sanchez_authority = Math.max(0, Q.sanchez_authority - 15); Q.federal_committee_balance -= 6; if (Math.random() < 0.4) { window.SpainGame.oust(Q, true); Q.bluff_expelled = 1; } }
!}

[? if bluff_won = 1 : The motion is never tabled. [+ challenger +] says there was never any challenge. ?][? if bluff_won = 0 : [? if bluff_expelled = 1 : The Federal Committee answers your dare by removing you, and the ethics committee opens proceedings for "disloyalty to the party's organs". You are expelled from the PSOE. ?][? if bluff_expelled = 0 : The critics table the motion. You survive the night, barely, and everyone knows the next vote is a matter of time. ?] ?]

@c_primary
on-arrival: {! Q.populism += 1; Q.sanchismo += 3; window.SpainGame.leadershipElection(Q, 5); !}
go-to: primary_result

@lead_forced
title: The forced primary
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: lead_forced_due = 1 and sanchez_leader = 1

= The forced primary

Your authority has collapsed. The Federal Committee convenes an extraordinary leadership election, and you cannot stop it. [+ challenger +] is the candidate of the federations. All that remains is to fight it.

- @f_fight: Fight for the members' votes
- @f_withdraw: Withdraw and leave with dignity

@f_fight
on-arrival: {! window.SpainGame.leadershipElection(Q, -3); if (!Q.primary_won && (Q.lead_confronted || Q.populism >= 6)) { Q.expelled = 1; } !}

[? if primary_won = 1 : Against every prediction, the members keep you. The apparatus is humiliated, and your authority is rebuilt from the ground up. ?][? if primary_won = 0 : [+ psoe_leader +] wins. [? if expelled = 1 : Within weeks your open war with the leadership ends in an expulsion file. You are no longer a member of the PSOE. ?] ?]

@f_withdraw
on-arrival: {! window.SpainGame.oust(Q, false); !}

You do not stand. [+ psoe_leader +] becomes Secretary-General unopposed.

@exile
title: After Ferraz
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: exile_pending = 1

= After Ferraz

[? if expelled = 1 : You have been expelled from the PSOE. ?][? if expelled = 0 : You are no longer Secretary-General. ?] Your phone keeps ringing anyway. Some calls are offers.

[? if can_join_cs = 1 : Albert Rivera's people suggest that a moderate social democrat would be welcome in Ciudadanos. ?][? if can_join_up = 1 : Podemos sounds you out about joining a broad progressive front. ?] Your own followers want you to start again under a new name. Your pollsters think a party of your own could start at around [+ new_party_prospect +]%; your personal following and an anti-establishment profile are what it would run on. Every vote it wins would come out of the PSOE or Podemos, splitting the left in every province, and many voters would see it as a vanity project.

- @join_cs: Join Ciudadanos
- @join_up: Join Podemos
- @new_party: Found your own party
- @backbench: Stay in the PSOE as a backbench deputy and wait
- @retire: Retire from politics

@join_cs
choose-if: can_join_cs = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Ciudadanos only wants a proven moderate (a centrist economic line) with good relations with them.
on-arrival: {! window.SpainGame.joinParty(Q, 'cs'); Q.month_actions += 1; !}

You sign up with Ciudadanos at a packed press conference. The PSOE calls it treason; Rivera calls it the birth of a great centre. You will have to earn your place in a party that is not yours.

@join_up
choose-if: can_join_up = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Podemos only wants a proven progressive (a left or progressive line) with good relations with them.
on-arrival: {! window.SpainGame.joinParty(Q, 'up'); Q.month_actions += 1; !}

You join Podemos's lists as an independent. The left calls it the end of the PSOE's monopoly; the PSOE calls it the end of Pedro Sánchez.

@new_party
title: Found your own party

= A new party

What do you call it?

- @name_avanza: Avanza
- @name_rumbo: Nuevo Rumbo
- @name_alternativa: La Alternativa

@name_avanza
on-arrival: {! window.SpainGame.joinParty(Q, 'ps', 'Avanza'); Q.month_actions += 1; !}
go-to: founded

@name_rumbo
on-arrival: {! window.SpainGame.joinParty(Q, 'ps', 'Nuevo Rumbo'); Q.month_actions += 1; !}
go-to: founded

@name_alternativa
on-arrival: {! window.SpainGame.joinParty(Q, 'ps', 'La Alternativa'); Q.month_actions += 1; !}
go-to: founded

@founded
title: The founding

= The founding

[+ new_party_name +] is launched in a sports hall in Madrid. [? if populism >= 5 : Your anti-establishment message, "neither the apparatus nor the IBEX", fills it. ?][? if populism < 5 : The hall is respectable rather than full; you are known as a man of the apparatus you are now running against. ?] The first polls give it [+ player_poll +]%.

@backbench
choose-if: expelled = 0
unavailable-subtitle: You have been expelled from the party.
on-arrival: backbench = 1; backbench_since = time

You take a seat at the back of the PSOE group. The new leadership watches you as closely as the PP does. If they stumble, the members may remember you.

@retire
on-arrival: retired = 1

You leave politics, and write a book about it.

@comeback
title: The members remember
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: comeback_ready = 1 and backbench = 1 and election_year = 0

= The members remember

The PSOE under [+ psoe_leader +] is sinking in the polls. Members are signing a petition for a new primary, and many of them want you on the ballot.

- @comeback_run: Run in the primary
- @comeback_wait: Not yet
- @comeback_leave: Leave the PSOE for good

@comeback_run
on-arrival: {! var b = Q.backbench_since; window.SpainGame.leadershipElection(Q, 4); if (!Q.primary_won) { Q.backbench = 1; Q.backbench_since = b; Q.comeback_next = Q.time + 24; } !}

[? if primary_won = 1 : Pedro Sánchez is Secretary-General of the PSOE again. The barons who threw you out will have to work with you. ?][? if primary_won = 0 : [+ psoe_leader +] holds on. The members were tempted, not convinced. ?]

@comeback_wait
on-arrival: comeback_next = time + 6

You let them sign. The longer they wait, the louder they will ask.

@comeback_leave
on-arrival: backbench = 0; backbench_since = 0

You hand in your membership card. The question is where to go next.

@player_line
title: How will your party vote?
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: exiled = 1 and acting = 1 and election_year = 0 and player_line_set = 0 and formation_weeks >= 1

= How will [+ my_party +] vote?

Congress is hung. [? if player_is_right_cand = 1 : As the largest party of the right, you are the right's candidate; ?][? if player_is_right_cand = 0 : [+ right_leader +] is the right's candidate; ?] [+ psoe_leader +] leads the PSOE. With [+ player_seats +] deputies, [+ my_party +] has to choose. [? if player_is_ps = 1 : [? if player_seats > congress_psoe_seats : Your party is bigger than the PSOE: the left's candidate would be you. ?] ?]

- @line_right_coalition: [? if player_is_right_cand = 1 : Stand as the right's candidate, in coalition with the PP ?][? if player_is_right_cand = 0 : Enter a coalition government with [+ right_leader +] ?]
- @line_right_support: [? if player_is_right_cand = 1 : Stand as the right's candidate, alone ?][? if player_is_right_cand = 0 : Support [+ right_leader +] from outside ?]
- @line_left_coalition: Enter a coalition government with the PSOE
- @line_left_support: Support the PSOE's candidate from outside, abstain on the right's
- @line_abstain: Abstain on every candidate
- @line_against: Vote against every candidate and force new elections

@line_right_coalition
choose-if: player_is_cs = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Only Ciudadanos would join the right in government.
on-arrival: {! Q.player_line_right = 'coalition'; Q.player_line_left = 'no'; Q.player_line_set = 1; Q.rel_pp += 5; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, -0.5, -0.5); } !}

Ministries in exchange for your votes. Your old comrades will never forgive the photograph.

@line_right_support
on-arrival: {! Q.player_line_right = 'support'; Q.player_line_left = 'no'; Q.player_line_set = 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, -0.5, 0); } !}

Your deputies will vote for [+ right_leader +], in exchange for a programme.

@line_left_coalition
choose-if: player_is_cs = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Ciudadanos will not sit in a cabinet with the PSOE.
on-arrival: {! Q.player_line_left = 'coalition'; Q.player_line_right = 'no'; Q.player_line_set = 1; Q.rel_psoe = (Q.rel_psoe || 20) + 5; !}

You offer the PSOE a coalition. The irony is not lost on anyone.

@line_left_support
on-arrival: {! Q.player_line_left = 'support'; Q.player_line_right = 'abstain'; Q.player_line_set = 1; !}

Support for the PSOE's candidate, without joining the government.

@line_abstain
on-arrival: {! Q.player_line_left = 'abstain'; Q.player_line_right = 'abstain'; Q.player_line_set = 1; !}

Your deputies will abstain and let the others decide.

@line_against
on-arrival: {! Q.player_line_left = 'no'; Q.player_line_right = 'no'; Q.player_line_set = 1; Q.populism += 1; !}

No to everyone. If nobody else can count to 176, Spain will vote again.

@auto_government
title: A government is formed
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: auto_formed = 1
on-arrival: auto_formed = 0

= A government is formed

Congress invests [+ pm +]. Spain has a [+ government_type +]. [? if player_in_government = 1 : [+ my_party +] is in government. ?][? if sanchez_pm = 1 : Pedro Sánchez is Prime Minister. ?]

@pp_leader_falls
title: The PP changes leader
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: pp_leader_falls_due = 1 and election_year = 0
on-arrival: {! window.SpainGame.choosePPLeader(Q); !}

= The PP changes leader

[+ pp_old_leader +] has lost [? if pm_is_pp = 0 : the government ?][? if pm_is_pp = 1 : the party's confidence ?], and the PP will not forgive it. After weeks of pressure from the regional barons, [+ pp_old_leader +] resigns. The party congress chooses [+ pp_leader +].

[? if pp_style_hard = 1 : The new leader promises to recover the voters who left for Vox: a harder line on Catalonia, on taxes and on immigration. Vox's leaders smile; the PNV stops returning calls. ?][? if pp_style_moderate = 1 : The new leader promises a calmer, more centrist PP, open to State pacts. Ciudadanos's voters start coming home; Vox calls it the "cowardly right". ?]

- @pp_pact: Offer the new leader a State pact on pensions and Catalonia
- @pp_same: "Same PP, new face": tie them to the corruption of the past
- @pp_wait: Watch and wait

@pp_pact
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_pp += 8; Q.progressives_dissent += 5; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, -0.3, 0); } !}

The offer is received politely and declined politely. Moderate voters noticed it was made.

@pp_same
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_pp -= 6; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'young', 1); } !}

The corruption files are reopened on every talk show.

@pp_wait
on-arrival: institutionalists_dissent -= 1

You let the new leader make the first mistakes.
